answer:
Add this entry to your agent’s MCP configuration, replacing the home path with an absolute path:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colony": {
      "command": "colony",
      "args": ["--home", "/absolute/path/to/agent-home", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

If `colony` is not on your PATH, use its absolute executable path. [README.md:66](README.md#L66)

